rst-hand, accessing devlogs, and chatting with other players. We’ve set up a minimal, straightforward structure for direct communication.Join the community before setting up your shop: 👉 https://discord.gg/SbY9JRRaZ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:07:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034413","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:06:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4737980-1846651706691225","game_id":"steam-4737980","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Nextfest Demo Live Gameplay","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:50:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4737980-1845383656377138","game_id":"steam-4737980","kind":"announcement","title":"Potions & Passions: Therapist for Monsters | Numbers","summary":"Potion Ingredients & Items: 100+ Unique Ingredients (From swamp mushrooms and vampire blood-blossoms to ifrit embers and mystic herbs — a massive alchemy inventory)Cauldron & Potion Recipes: 1,600+ Custom Concoctions (Calming, Cooling, Aromatic, and Wildly Creative Potion Combinations)Customer & Monster Variety: 180+ Distinct Monster Designs (Vampires, Trolls, Werewolves, and Ifrits — including solo visitors and bickering married couples with special dialogues)Random Dialogues & Reactions: 550+ ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:55:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377138","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4737980-1844115010498586","game_id":"steam-4737980","kind":"announcement","title":"Potions & Passions: Therapist for Monsters — Gameplay and Core Mechanics","summary":"Potions & Passions: Spooky Cozy is a charming simulation game where you manage a midnight apothecary, brewing bespoke concoctions for eccentric monster patrons, balancing faction relations, and keeping your shop afloat. Below is a comprehensive guide covering all core gameplay systems and mechanics you will encounter on your journey. 1. The Night Shift and Monster PatronsNight Cycles: Each workday begins after dusk. The number of visiting customers varies each night (typically between 3 and 8 pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T09:05:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498586","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4737980-1834602721198767","game_id":"steam-4737980","kind":"announcement","title":"MEET THE PATIENTS: Official Potion Shop Case Files!","summary":"MEET THE PATIENTS: Official Potion Shop Case Files! Hello community! As you know, in Potions & Passions: Therapist for Monsters, your job isn't warfare, it's mental health! Every mythical creature walking through our shop door carries a heavy, hilarious, or downright bizarre emotional trauma. Before you start brewing remedies in the upcoming demo, here is the official, fully detailed psychiatric case file of our local neighbourhood monsters. Which one are you most excited to treat? FACTION 1: TH","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T12:45:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4737980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-1